"Chloroplasts use sunlight for photosynthesis, so only plant cells have them.": "Los cloroplastos usan la luz del sol para la fotosíntesis, por eso solo las células vegetales los tienen.",
"Tap a clear area inside a cell (the large vacuole).": "Toca una zona clara dentro de una célula (la vacuola grande).",
"The large vacuole stores water and nutrients and helps the cell keep its shape.": "La vacuola grande almacena agua y nutrientes y ayuda a la célula a mantener su forma.",
